  "details": "Essentially, when you have multiple objects with pick-up scripts move all at once (Example being using another object with collision to force move them all), it breaks the instance of the world.\n\nWhen the instance of the world breaks, you get the tooltip that your able to pick up something even if nothing is in range, and you can 'grab', but nothing is grabbed. It seems that any interactable objects no longer become interactable as well due to this.\n\nI've had this happen on my world, and another world as well, both results happened when the stated above situation happened.\n\nHeres a slight picture so you can see what I sorta mean, or atleast, just imagine all these pickups being moved at one time by another pickup. That's essentially what broke the world.",
